          </div>
        </nav>
        <div class="eyebrow">Healthcare Compliance Operations</div>
        <h1>Turn complex healthcare workflows into audit-ready operational evidence.</h1>
        <p>SLP CONNECT™ by Strategic Lab Partners gives healthcare, diagnostics, laboratory, genomics, and clinical research organizations a centralized management ecosystem for digital chain-of-custody, logistics visibility, inventory oversight, documentation control, exception tracking, and audit-ready reporting.</p>
        <div class="btns">
