    <section id="challenge">
      <div class="wrap split">
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow">The Compliance Challenge</div>
          <h2>Compliance is only as strong as the evidence behind it.</h2>
          <p>Policies, training, certifications, and governance frameworks are essential, but they are not enough on their own. In regulated healthcare environments, compliance programs depend on operational workflows that involve specimen collection, kitting, fulfillment, shipping, inventory, vendor handoffs, documentation, exceptions, and reporting.</p>
          <p>When those workflows live across disconnected systems, spreadsheets, emails, and manual processes, compliance teams can be left with limited visibility into the activities they are expected to monitor, validate, and defend.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="panel">
          <div class="quote">The future of healthcare compliance will be built on connected, visible, and defensible operations.</div>
          <p style="margin-top:22px">SLP CONNECT™ helps organizations move from fragmented oversight to one source of operational truth.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="solution" style="background:var(--light)">
      <div class="wrap split">
        <div class="panel" style="background:white">
          <h3>From operational activity to compliance evidence</h3>
          <p>SLP CONNECT™ helps demonstrate how operational visibility can function as a practical compliance control. By centralizing critical workflow data, the platform helps teams see where items are, who handled them, when they moved, what changed, and whether an exception occurred.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow">The Platform</div>
          <h2>A connected management ecosystem for regulated healthcare workflows.</h2>
          <p>SLP CONNECT™ connects orders, inventory, fulfillment, logistics, chain-of-custody, documentation, exceptions, and reporting into a more unified operating environment.</p>
          <p>For compliance leaders, that means stronger visibility for audits, vendor oversight, investigations, quality assurance, operational continuity, and patient trust.</p>
          <div class="btns"><a class="btn light" href="#features">Explore capabilities</a></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="features">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="eyebrow">Core Capabilities</div>
        <h2>Designed to make healthcare operations visible, documented, and audit-ready.</h2>
        <div class="grid">
          <article class="card"><div class="icon">1</div><h3>Digital Chain-of-Custody</h3><p>Document handoffs, movement, storage events, fulfillment steps, and exceptions across complex physical workflows.</p></article>
          <article class="card"><div class="icon">2</div><h3>Real-Time Logistics Visibility</h3><p>Track shipments, materials, kits, and operational status so teams can identify issues earlier and respond faster.</p></article>
          <article class="card"><div class="icon">3</div><h3>Inventory Oversight</h3><p>Centralize inventory status, material readiness, and fulfillment visibility across internal and external stakeholders.</p></article>
          <article class="card"><div class="icon">4</div><h3>Documentation Control</h3><p>Keep operational records organized, retrievable, and aligned with compliance, audit, and quality needs.</p></article>
          <article class="card"><div class="icon">5</div><h3>Exception Tracking</h3><p>Make deviations, delays, incomplete documentation, and workflow issues visible before they become audit problems.</p></article>
          <article class="card"><div class="icon">6</div><h3>Audit-Ready Reporting</h3><p>Convert workflow activity into reliable, traceable evidence that supports audits, investigations, and program oversight.</p></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="dark" id="use-cases">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="eyebrow">Where SLP CONNECT™ Fits</div>
        <h2>Built for healthcare organizations that need to prove operational control.</h2>
        <p>SLP CONNECT™ supports teams operating in complex, time-sensitive environments where compliance expectations must connect to day-to-day execution.</p>
        <div class="use-grid">
          <div class="use"><h3>Healthcare Compliance Programs</h3><p>Strengthen oversight by linking policies and expectations to operational evidence.</p></div>
          <div class="use"><h3>Diagnostics & Laboratory Operations</h3><p>Support specimen logistics, kitting, fulfillment, inventory controls, and documentation integrity.</p></div>
          <div class="use"><h3>Genomics & Clinical Research</h3><p>Improve traceability across sensitive workflows involving materials, shipments, vendors, and exceptions.</p></div>
          <div class="use"><h3>Large-Scale Compliance Events</h3><p>Track educational materials, sponsor assets, shipments, inventory, on-site handoffs, and post-event reporting.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
