          <h2>Can your organization answer these questions with confidence?</h2>
          <p>Compliance education becomes more valuable when it gives professionals tools they can apply immediately. These questions help teams assess whether critical workflows are visible, documented, traceable, and defensible.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="checklist">
          <div class="check"><b>✓</b><span>Are workflow handoffs documented?</span></div>
          <div class="check"><b>✓</b><span>Can shipments and materials be tracked in real time?</span></div>
          <div class="check"><b>✓</b><span>Are exceptions visible and escalated?</span></div>
          <div class="check"><b>✓</b><span>Is inventory status centralized?</span></div>
          <div class="check"><b>✓</b><span>Are vendor activities traceable?</span></div>
          <div class="check"><b>✓</b><span>Can documentation be retrieved during an audit?</span></div>
